   "script": "Route123_EventScript_151CFF",
   "texts": {
    "Route123_Text_1C009E": "They say that good times are filled\\nwith good aromas.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C00D4": "Oh...\\nI smell the bitter scent of misery...$",
    "Route123_Text_1C0100": "The BERRY MASTER's garden is filled\\nwith uplifting fragrances.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 28,
   "x": 38,
   "y": 13,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LITTLE_GIRL_1",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route123_EventScript_151DAD",
   "texts": {
    "Route123_Text_1C049C": "YUKI: Okay!\\nWe're beating the TRAINER's POKéMON!$",
    "Route123_Text_1C04CD": "YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C0519": "YUKI: It's no fun to battle if you\\ndon't have two POKéMON.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C04E3": "YUKI: Why are you so strong?\\nWe've never lost before.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 29,
   "x": 37,
   "y": 13,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LITTLE_GIRL_1",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route123_EventScript_151D92",
   "texts": {
    "Route123_Text_1C03CB": "MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your\\nPOKéMON won't cry when they lose.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C040E": "MIU: Uh-oh, we lost.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C0462": "MIU: It's no fun to battle if you\\ndon't have two POKéMON.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C0423": "MIU: TRAINER, your POKéMON are\\nstrong because you are friends.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 30,
   "x": 138,
   "y": 12,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_PSYCHIC_M",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route123_EventScript_151D16",
   "texts": {
    "Route123_Text_1C013F": "Being a psychic is about willpower.\\pI've willed myself not to lose to\\nanyone. That makes me strong!$",
    "Route123_Text_1C01A3": "I feel sad...$",
    "Route123_Text_1C01B1": "Being a psychic is about willpower.\\nI thought I wouldn't lose to you...$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 31,
   "x": 50,
   "y": 16,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LASS",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route123_EventScript_151D54",
   "texts": {
    "Route123_Text_1C028C": "Don't be too happy if your POKéMON\\ndevelop psychic powers.\\pYou need to refine those powers to\\nmake them really useful.$",
    "Route123_Text_1C0303": "Astounding!$",
    "Route123_Text_1C030F": "We all have psychic powers.\\nWe've just forgotten how to use them.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
